{
  "_doc": "Signature powers for fusions (enemies.json 'gives'). In a mutation the BODY parent decides WHAT the move does ('does', aimed at you, or at its friends when 'support') and the other parent decides HOW it is delivered ('shape'). A power with a 'skin' turns the shape's lines into itself (laser lines, spear thrusts...). Built purely from this data: a new monster needs 'gives' in enemies.json, and a new power one entry here.",
